#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:95
msgid ""
"Agent Install scripts can be downloaded from |morpheus| by selecting "
"``Actions > Download Agent Script`` from an Server detail page, then run "
"manually on the target host when required for a given managed resource. "
"Please note the script will be unique per managed resource and should not"
" be saved to run as needed on any arbitrary resources in the future."
msgstr ""
"Los scripts de instalación del Agente pueden descargarse desde |morpheus| "
"seleccionando ``Actions > Download Agent Script`` desde una página de "
"detalle del Servidor, luego ejecutarse manualmente en el host de destino "
"cuando sea necesario para un recurso administrado dado. Tenga en cuenta "
"que el script será único por recurso administrado y no debe guardarse para "
"ejecutarse según sea necesario en cualquier recurso arbitrario en el "
"futuro."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:97
msgid ""
"When installing on Windows, continue with the steps below to complete "
"manual installation:"
msgstr ""
"Al instalar en Windows, continúe con los pasos a continuación para "
"completar la instalación manual:"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:99
msgid "Open powershell as an administrator"
msgstr "Abra PowerShell como administrador"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:100
msgid ""
"Run the ``unblock-file cmdlet`` against the download agent installation "
"script:"
msgstr ""
"Ejecute el ``unblock-file cmdlet`` contra el script de instalación del "
"agente descargado:"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:102
msgid ""
"Unblock-File -Path "
"C:\\Users\\User01\\Documents\\Downloads\\agentInstall.ps1\n"
"\n"
"Get-ExecutionPolicy\n"
"\n"
"Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy Unrestricted -Scope CurrentUser"
msgstr ""
"Unblock-File -Path C:\\Users\\User01\\Documents\\Downloads\\agentInstall.ps"
"1\n\nGet-ExecutionPolicy\n\nSet-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy "
"Unrestricted -Scope CurrentUser"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:110
msgid ""
"After running the powershell script, ensure the script downloaded the msi"
" and the Agent service started correctly:"
msgstr ""
"Después de ejecutar el script de PowerShell, asegúrese de que el script "
"descargó el msi y el servicio del Agente se inició correctamente:"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:112
msgid "Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser"
msgstr "Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser"

