"En algunas situaciones, puede ser necesario reiniciar el Agente de "
"|morpheus| en el host para resincronizar la comunicación del Agente al "
"appliance de |morpheus|."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:124
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:126
msgid ""
"On the target host, run ``sudo morpheus-node-ctl restart morphd`` and the"
" |morpheus| agent will restart. ``morpheus-node-ctl status`` will also "
"show the agent status."
msgstr ""
"En el host de destino, ejecute ``sudo morpheus-node-ctl restart morphd`` y "
"el agente de |morpheus| se reiniciará. ``morpheus-node-ctl status`` "
"también mostrará el estado del agente."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:129
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:131
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Windows Agent service can be restarted in Administrative "
"Tools > Services."
msgstr ""
"El servicio del Agente Windows de |morpheus| puede reiniciarse en "
"Herramientas Administrativas > Servicios."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:133
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Remote Console is not dependent on Agent communication and"
" can be used to install or restart the |morpheus| agent on an Instance."
msgstr ""
"La Consola Remota de |morpheus| no depende de la comunicación del Agente y "
"puede usarse para instalar o reiniciar el agente de |morpheus| en una "
"Instancia."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:136
msgid "Uninstall |morpheus| Agent"
msgstr "Desinstalar el Agente de |morpheus|"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:139
msgid "Linux Agents"
msgstr "Agentes Linux"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:141
msgid ""
"You can use the following to uninstall the linux agent (contains commands"
" for both rpm and deb agents)"
msgstr ""
"Puede usar lo siguiente para desinstalar el agente Linux (contiene "
"comandos para agentes rpm y deb)"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:143
msgid ""
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/morpheus.list \\\n"
"sudo morpheus-node-ctl kill \\\n"
"sudo apt-get -y purge morpheus-node \\\n"
"sudo apt-get -y purge morpheus-vm-node \\\n"
"sudo yum -y remove morpheus-node \\\n"
"sudo yum -y remove morpheus-vm-node \\\n"
"sudo yum clean all \\\n"
"sudo systemctl stop morpheus-node-runsvdir \\\n"
"sudo rm -f /etc/systemd/system/morpheus-node-runsvdir.service \\\n"
"sudo systemctl daemon-reload \\\n"
"sudo rm -rf /var/run/morpheus-node \\\n"
"sudo rm -rf /opt/morpheus-node \\\n"
"sudo rm -rf /etc/morpheus \\\n"
"sudo rm -rf /var/log/morpheus-node \\\n"
"sudo pkill runsv \\\n"
"sudo pkill runsvdir \\\n"
"sudo pkill morphd \\\n"
"sudo usermod -l morpheus-old morpheus-node \\"
msgstr ""
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/morpheus.list \\\nsudo morpheus-node-ctl "
"kill \\\nsudo apt-get -y purge morpheus-node \\\nsudo apt-get -y purge "
"morpheus-vm-node \\\nsudo yum -y remove morpheus-node \\\nsudo yum -y "
"remove morpheus-vm-node \\\nsudo yum clean all \\\nsudo systemctl stop "
"morpheus-node-runsvdir \\\nsudo rm -f "
"/etc/systemd/system/morpheus-node-runsvdir.service \\\nsudo systemctl "
"daemon-reload \\\nsudo rm -rf /var/run/morpheus-node \\\nsudo rm -rf "
"/opt/morpheus-node \\\nsudo rm -rf /etc/morpheus \\\nsudo rm -rf "
"/var/log/morpheus-node \\\nsudo pkill runsv \\\nsudo pkill runsvdir "
"\\\nsudo pkill morphd \\\nsudo usermod -l morpheus-old morpheus-node \\"

